WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Welcome to the Man of Recaps, 

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.700
this is Attack on Titan, 
the final episode.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:08.333
Our protagonist, Eren Yeager,
has now become the final villain.

00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:11.433
To protect his home, the island of Paradis, 
from the outside world, 

00:00:11.433 --> 00:00:15.000
He's unleashed the million Colossal Titans 
that made up the walls

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.866
to kill every other person on the planet.

00:00:17.866 --> 00:00:21.000
But now all of our main characters 
from Paradis and Marley,

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.100
have banded together to stop him!

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.900
The last part ended as Eren's friends
leapt from the plane

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:29.466
for a final fight on Eren's
giant new skeletal body.

00:00:29.466 --> 00:00:31.766
Plan A is to take out
Zeke the Beast Titan, 

00:00:31.766 --> 00:00:33.933
so Reiner, the Armored Titan, transforms

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:35.200
and knocks out him immediately.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:37.066
The hope is without Zeke's royal blood,

00:00:37.066 --> 00:00:39.866
Eren will lose his control over 
the Eldian founder, Ymir.

00:00:39.866 --> 00:00:41.566
Unfortunately, this wasn't the real Zeke,

00:00:41.566 --> 00:00:44.133
it was just a construct,
his real body is hidden from them.

00:00:44.133 --> 00:00:46.900
So it's on to Plan B,
where Armin will use the explosive power

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:49.200
of the Colossal Titan
to nuke this whole thing.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:50.633
But Eren planned for this, so whoa!

00:00:50.633 --> 00:00:53.400
Armin is immediately
swallowed and taken off the board.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.733
So it's onto Plan C, where 
Pieck, the Cart Titan

00:00:55.733 --> 00:00:57.500
will strap some dynamite to Eren's head

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.200
and blow it up the old fashioned way.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:00.433
But oh! She's impaled,

00:01:00.433 --> 00:01:02.566
by another titan construct Eren’s made.

00:01:02.566 --> 00:01:06.733
Yeah he's got a whole army of them,
every titan warrior that's ever lived,

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:08.900
including their old friends
like Bertholdt.

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:11.000
Now for Plan D, there is no Plan D,

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.500
they're just desperately fighting to survive,

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:15.366
and very quickly, things look bleak.

00:01:15.366 --> 00:01:16.966
But now who's this flying in?

00:01:16.966 --> 00:01:19.600
Our gang is picked up by a 
giant bird titan!

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:22.966
Yeah remember little Falco
just got the power of the Jaw Titan,

00:01:22.966 --> 00:01:25.666
and for some reason,
his manifested as a bird.

00:01:25.666 --> 00:01:29.233
With a bird's eye view, Mikasa spots
the weird cow titan that swallowed Armin,

00:01:29.233 --> 00:01:31.500
so it's slingshot
time as she's trying to get him.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:35.333
And it's fight round two, where all
our characters get their own hero moment.

00:01:35.333 --> 00:01:36.933
But they're still just too outnumbered,

00:01:36.933 --> 00:01:39.733
until, one of the construct titans
turns on the others!

00:01:39.733 --> 00:01:41.633
Wait, is that our old friend Ymir?!

00:01:41.633 --> 00:01:44.333
While Armin’s unconscious, 
his mind is in the Eldian Coordinate,

00:01:44.333 --> 00:01:47.033
where he hangs out with Zeke,
who's basically given up on life.

00:01:47.033 --> 00:01:49.033
But Armin convinces him 
humanity's worth saving, 

00:01:49.033 --> 00:01:51.066
without humans,
you wouldn't have baseball.

00:01:51.066 --> 00:01:53.566
And the spirits of our other titan
warrior friends are here too,

00:01:53.566 --> 00:01:56.366
so it's like, “I know you guys are dead,
but we could really use your help.”

00:01:56.366 --> 00:01:58.900
So all our dead titan friends
wake up and switch sides,

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:01.266
and now Mikasa is able to rescue Armin!

00:02:01.266 --> 00:02:03.600
And Zeke wakes up too, “Here I am, come kill me.”

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:06.933
And Captain Levi, who's killed 
the Beast Titan a dozen times,

00:02:06.933 --> 00:02:09.133
finally puts him to rest for good.

00:02:09.133 --> 00:02:11.200
And it works! The Rumbling stops.

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:12.933
But Eren himself is still a problem.

00:02:12.933 --> 00:02:15.333
So it's Jean who swings in there, 
grabs the detonator,

00:02:15.333 --> 00:02:17.533
 blows Eren's head clean off!

00:02:17.533 --> 00:02:19.800
Which reveals the weird
jellyfish vertebrae thing

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:21.433
that is the founding Titan.

00:02:21.433 --> 00:02:23.533
So now it's time for Eren's best friend Armin,

00:02:23.533 --> 00:02:25.066
“Sayonara, Eren.”

00:02:25.066 --> 00:02:28.133
Kaboom! Nukes the whole thing!

00:02:28.133 --> 00:02:29.800
But of course it's not going to be
that easy.

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:31.933
Eren reforms in a more normal titan body.

00:02:31.933 --> 00:02:33.933
The jellyfish thing
survived the blast too,

00:02:33.933 --> 00:02:37.233
and now it farts out a 
bunch of titan-creating gas,

00:02:37.233 --> 00:02:40.100
transforming all the Eldians into titans!

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:42.033
Leading the attack to reconnect with Eren.

00:02:42.033 --> 00:02:44.633
So it's the final battle!
Titan punch, hyah!

00:02:44.633 --> 00:02:48.100
But Mikasa is sitting this fight out,
she can't bring herself to kill Eren.

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:50.033
In fact she envisions the life 
they could have had,

00:02:50.033 --> 00:02:52.333
if he didn't become a genocidal maniac.

00:02:52.333 --> 00:02:55.366
But he did. So Mikasa accepts
what she has to do...

00:02:55.366 --> 00:02:59.433
Swings on in there, into this new titan's mouth 
to find Eren's prime body 

00:02:59.433 --> 00:03:03.900
and cuts his head off! Mikasa kills Eren!

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:06.800
She gently takes his severed head
and gives it a smooch.

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:09.566
Yes, of course, 
she's always loved him.

00:03:09.566 --> 00:03:12.466
But before Eren died, with the power 
of the Eldian Coordinate,

00:03:12.466 --> 00:03:16.800
he’s able to have a final chat with his friends
to explain his motivations.

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:19.233
And turns out he wanted 
his friends to kill him!

00:03:19.233 --> 00:03:22.166
His real plan was to become 
an apocalyptic threat,

00:03:22.166 --> 00:03:25.633
so Paradis and Marley could unite
against a common enemy.

00:03:25.633 --> 00:03:28.333
And with the island Eldians 
saving the world from him,

00:03:28.333 --> 00:03:31.866
the rest of the world would accept them 
and they could finally have peace.

00:03:31.866 --> 00:03:34.666
So Eren Yeager really was good all along!

00:03:34.666 --> 00:03:36.733
...Well, his motivations at least.

00:03:36.733 --> 00:03:40.533
He did in fact kill 80% 
of the world's population.

00:03:40.533 --> 00:03:43.433
Armin’s like, “Man, I'm sure 
there was a better way.”

00:03:43.433 --> 00:03:44.966
But our best bros talk it out,

00:03:44.966 --> 00:03:47.233
realize both their hands 
are stained with blood.

00:03:47.233 --> 00:03:49.800
So it's like, “I love you, man. 
See you in hell.”

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:52.500
So back in reality, Armin and Mikasa 
mourn their best friend Eren,

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:54.900
now that they understand
his real intentions.

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:57.366
And with Eren’s death, 
the jellyfish monster disappeared.

00:03:57.366 --> 00:03:59.533
It has something to do with 
the founder Ymir

00:03:59.533 --> 00:04:02.833
getting over her abusive relationship 
with the old Eldian king Fritz?

00:04:02.833 --> 00:04:05.933
Which means the power of the titans
is gone from the world,

00:04:05.933 --> 00:04:08.133
all our Eldians transform back!

00:04:08.133 --> 00:04:10.166
And the original dream of the Scouts,

00:04:10.166 --> 00:04:13.233
a world without titans,
is finally realized.

00:04:13.233 --> 00:04:15.066
Now they've just got 
humans to contend with,

00:04:15.066 --> 00:04:17.366
and Marley might want to seek retribution.

00:04:17.366 --> 00:04:19.366
But Eren's plan seems to work,

00:04:19.366 --> 00:04:22.300
as Armin says, 
“Yo, we just saved your butts.”

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:24.666
“I think that proves
we're not your enemies.”

00:04:24.666 --> 00:04:27.433
So Eren Yeager caused 
a near apocalyptic event,

00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:31.233
but humanity will eventually rebuild,
and the future looks bright.

00:04:31.233 --> 00:04:33.933
A few years later, our crew 
returns to Paradis Island,

00:04:33.933 --> 00:04:35.633
which, still under control of the Yeagerists,

00:04:35.633 --> 00:04:37.233
has become even more militaristic.

00:04:37.233 --> 00:04:39.633
But Armin is optimistic
that peace talks will work.

00:04:39.633 --> 00:04:41.466
Mikasa is not with them, 
she went home earlier

00:04:41.466 --> 00:04:43.600
to bury Eren's head 
under their favorite tree.

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:46.966
She bids farewell to Eren, 
the man she loved but had to kill.

00:04:46.966 --> 00:04:49.666
And that's where Attack on
Titan comes to an end.

00:04:49.666 --> 00:04:50.833
Except for the credits scene,

00:04:50.833 --> 00:04:54.333
which shows the world did go through
an era of peace and prosperity.

00:04:54.333 --> 00:04:57.300
But eventually it seems humans
found another reason to kill each other.

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:59.800
And after seemingly destroying
civilization again,

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:03.166
a young child finds Eren's tree,
which has grown enormous.

00:05:03.166 --> 00:05:07.200
In fact it looks similar to when Ymir found
the jellyfish Founding Titan originally,

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:10.333
so maybe Titans will come
back in the world? Who knows?

00:05:11.166 --> 00:05:13.500
If you liked this recap, 
hit that subscribe button

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:16.500
for more of the best recaps 
of TV and movies.

